  (text "ESP32-C3FH4 (4MB flash in package) + 3.3V LDO.  GPIO2/GPIO8/GPIO9 are strapping pins: GPIO2 is pulled high by the\nSX1281 NRESET internal pull-up, GPIO8 high via LED/10k, GPIO9 = BOOT button.  40 MHz crystal." (at 12 15 0)
